 return '<div class="intake-subtle" style="margin-top:7px;padding:7px 9px;border-left:3px solid #687ba8;background:#f0f3fa"><strong>사용자 수정 '+fmt(om.correctionCount,0)+'영역</strong><br>자동 → 검토 반영<br>면적 '+fmt(om.automaticAreaPercent)+' → '+fmt(om.areaPercent)+'%<br>개수 '+fmt(om.automaticParticleCount,0)+' → '+fmt(om.particleCount,0)+'개</div>';
